.SH NAME
bpclm \- DTN bundle protocol convergence layer management daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBbpclm\fR \fIneighboring_node_ID\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBbpclm\fR is a background "daemon" task that manages the transmission of
bundles to a single designated neighboring node (as constrained by an
"egress plan" data structure for that node) by one or more convergence-layer
(CL) adapter output daemons (via buffer structures called "outducts").
.PP
\&\fBbpclm\fR is spawned automatically by \fBbpadmin\fR in response to the 's' (START)
command that starts operation of the Bundle Protocol, and it is terminated by
\&\fBbpadmin\fR in response to an 'x' (STOP) command.  \fBbpclm\fR can also be
spawned and terminated in response to commands that START and STOP the
corresponding node's egress plan.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBbpclm\fR terminated normally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.  If
this termination was not commanded, investigate and solve the problem identified
in the log file and use \fBbpadmin\fR to restart the egress plan for this node.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBbpclm\fR terminated abnormally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.
Investigate and solve the problem identified in the log file, then use
\&\fBbpadmin\fR to restart the egress plan for this node.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "bpclm can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "bpclm can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized Bundle Protocol operations.
.IP "No egress plan for this node" 4
.IX Item "No egress plan for this node"
No egress plan for the node identified by \fIneighboring_node_ID\fR has been
added to the BP database.  Use \fBbpadmin\fR to add and start the plan.
.IP "bpclm task is already started for this node" 4
.IX Item "bpclm task is already started for this node"
Redundant initiation of \fBbpclm\fR.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBbpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBbprc\fR\|(5)
